%% One scheduled agent run, end to end. Note what is NOT here: no write to the
%% tracker, and no change to any item. A run only reads, computes and records.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Agent worker (the clock)
  participant A as POST /api/agent/run
  participant S as Store adapter
  participant F as Facts + detector
  participant M as Model provider
  participant B as Brain (score, signals)
  participant D as Store (Postgres or files)

  W->>A: trigger run (schedule)
  Note over W,A: quiet hours respected. A run already in flight is joined, never duplicated
  A->>S: loadWorld()
  S->>D: ask for the base snapshot and the effective events
  D-->>S: items, updates, events
  S-->>A: the world
  loop for each active, unfinished item
    A->>F: build the item thread (last 5 updates, first name only)
    A->>M: detect(thread)
    alt provider answers inside the deadline
      M-->>A: phrases, weights, rationale
      Note over A: the score is recomputed from the phrases and OUR threshold decides
    else timeout, 5xx or a body that is not JSON
      M--xA: no usable answer
      A->>F: run the rule detector for that text instead
      Note over A: the error is counted and reported in the run result
    end
  end
  A->>F: install the verdicts as a detection override
  A->>B: getRun(), getSignals(), getRequests()
  B-->>A: signals with evidence, questions to ask, pending proposals
  A->>F: clear the override
  A->>D: record one run row (trigger, detector, model, snapshot)
  A-->>W: scanned, llmCalls, disagreements, open, errors
  Note over W,D: nothing was written to the tracker and no item changed. Only a person can do that
